    rdf:object "With a search service and an evidence model chosen in Settings, a web page becomes a source the same way. A page that disputes a statement without saying what is true instead arrives as a question for you to answer. Each web check sends that one statement to the services you chose, and paid services may charge. Leave it off for anything private." ;
